{"id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-theory.md","title":"Theory","display":"df-theory — Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-theory","aliases":["57-df-theory"],"display":"df-theory — Theory","depends_on":["[[57-df-sentence-set]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory — Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4c7cfc2c8937175\" href=\"?note=f4c7cfc2c8937175\" title=\"57-df-sentence-set\">57-df-sentence-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (句子集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (S-结构, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Th}(\\Phi) \\coloneqq \\{\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S \\mid \\Phi \\models \\varphi\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Th}(\\Phi) \\coloneqq \\{\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S \\mid \\Phi \\models \\varphi\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\coloneqq \\{\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S \\mid \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\coloneqq \\{\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S \\mid \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\Phi)\\)</span> is the <strong>theory generated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span></strong>, the set of all sentences logically entailed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> is the <strong>theory of the structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span></strong> (also called the <strong>complete theory of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span></strong>), containing all sentences true in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A theory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is <strong>complete</strong> if for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>, either <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in T\">\\(\\varphi \\in T\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi \\in T\">\\(\\neg\\varphi \\in T\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A theory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is <strong>consistent</strong> (written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\)</span>) if there exists a model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> such that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\models T\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\models T\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-sentence-set","status":"resolved","id":"f4c7cfc2c8937175","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据